              a: { zh: [
                '「真福八端」是耶穌在山中聖訓開首所講的八句祝福（瑪竇福音 5:3-10），描繪天國子民的生活，也是基督徒成聖的路線圖。「真福」意思是「有福的」，真正的幸福。',
                '1. 神貧的人：明白自己一無所有、完全需要天主，不倚靠錢財與地位——天國是他們的。\n2. 哀慟的人：為罪、為苦難、為他人的痛楚而哀傷——他們要受安慰。\n3. 溫良的人：謙和、不以力壓人——他們要承受土地。\n4. 飢渴慕義的人：渴望公義與天主的旨意——他們要得飽飫。\n5. 憐憫人的人：以慈悲待人——他們要受憐憫。\n6. 心裡潔淨的人：動機純正、不虛偽——他們要看見天主。\n7. 促進和平的人：締造和好、化解仇恨——他們要稱為天主的子女。\n8. 為義而受迫害的人：為信仰與正義忍受不公——天國是他們的。',
                '對男士來說：真福八端與世俗的「成功」價值剛好相反——不是強勢、佔有、勝利，而是謙卑、慈悲、和平與忠信。可以每天挑一端默想，問自己：今天我可以怎樣活出它？' ],
                en: [
                'The Beatitudes are eight blessings Jesus gave at the start of the Sermon on the Mount (Matthew 5:3-10). They describe the life of the people of God\'s kingdom and serve as a road map to holiness. “Blessed” means truly happy.',
                '1. The poor in spirit: those who know they need God and do not rely on wealth or status. The kingdom of heaven is theirs.\n2. Those who mourn: grieving over sin, suffering and the pain of others. They will be comforted.\n3. The meek: gentle and humble, not domineering. They will inherit the earth.\n4. Those who hunger and thirst for righteousness: longing for justice and God\'s will. They will be satisfied.\n5. The merciful: those who treat others with compassion. They will receive mercy.\n6. The clean of heart: sincere, without hypocrisy. They will see God.\n7. The peacemakers: those who reconcile and defuse hatred. They will be called children of God.\n8. Those persecuted for righteousness: enduring injustice for faith and what is right. The kingdom of heaven is theirs.',
                'For men: the Beatitudes turn worldly “success” upside down. They are not about power, possession or winning but about humility, mercy, peace and faithfulness. Try taking one beatitude a day and ask: how can I live this today?' ] },
              verses: ['mt5_3', 'mt7_24'], related: ['jesus', 'tencommandments', 'topic:purpose'] },

            { id: 'jesus', icon: 'fa-cross', t: { zh: '誰是耶穌？', en: 'Who is Jesus?' },
