              a: { zh: [
                '聖經是天主藉人的手寫成的啟示，是教會的聖言。天主教聖經共 73 卷：舊約 46 卷、新約 27 卷。',
                '舊約記載天主與以色列民的盟約與救恩歷史（梅瑟五書、歷史書、智慧書、先知書）；新約記載耶穌的生平、教會的開始與書信（四部福音、宗徒大事錄、書信、默示錄）。',
                '讀經建議：由福音開始（例如馬爾谷福音最短），每天一小段；用「神讀」的方法——誦讀、默想、祈禱、默觀；有不明白的地方，請教司鐸或參加讀經小組。教會也提供每日彌撒讀經，跟著禮儀年閱讀，是很好的習慣。' ],
                en: [
                'The Bible is God\'s revelation written through human authors; it is the Word of God in the Church. The Catholic Bible has 73 books: 46 in the Old Testament and 27 in the New.',
                'The Old Testament tells of God\'s covenant with Israel and the history of salvation (the Pentateuch, historical books, wisdom books and prophets). The New Testament recounts the life of Jesus, the beginning of the Church and the letters (the four Gospels, Acts, the Epistles and Revelation).',
                'Tips for reading: start with a Gospel (Mark is the shortest) and read a little each day; use lectio divina: read, reflect, pray, rest; ask a priest or join a Bible group for difficult passages. Following the daily Mass readings through the liturgical year is also a good habit.' ] },
              verses: ['tim3_16', 'ps119_105'], related: ['jesus', 'topic:prayer'] },

            { id: 'church', icon: 'fa-church', t: { zh: '什麼是教會？', en: 'What is the Church?' },
